Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,760] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 22 | Text: 我感觉所有一年能争一千万以上的人都具备以下三种能力
Segment #2   [00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:05,920] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 11 | Text: 这条视频建议大家多看几遍
Segment #3   [00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,220] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 17 | Text: 对大家在创业的道路上我感觉帮助会挺大的
Segment #4   [00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,600] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 先点赞收藏
Segment #5   [00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,180] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 15 | Text: 并不说你看完之后你就一定会赚到一千万
Segment #6   [00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:14,000] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 10 | Text: 是如果说你连这个都不懂的话
Segment #7   [00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,500] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 12 | Text: 你可能大概率是没有机会赚到钱的
Segment #8   [00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,160] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 即便有也是靠运气
Segment #9   [00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,280] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 10 | Text: 首先你要选一条超级大赛道
Segment #10  [00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,160] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是你想一年赚一千万的核心
Segment #11  [00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,600] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是你所在的赛道
Segment #12  [00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,880] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 它有一千万的体量
Segment #13  [00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,240] | Elapsed:  14.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是你去找一个
Segment #14  [00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:30,280] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 至少你要找到你的同行
Segment #15  [00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:33,700] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 16 | Text: 有五家到十家一年能做到五千万以上的
Segment #16  [00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,280] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 12 | Text: 这样你就做到它们的百分之二十
Segment #17  [00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,060] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 13 | Text: 百分之三十你就能赚到一千万了
Segment #18  [00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:39,340] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 你都不用去超过它们
Segment #19  [00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:40,760] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 或者说和它们做到一样
Segment #20  [00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:42,120] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 它有些内蒙的天花板
Segment #21  [00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:45,720] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 14 | Text: 就是你即使做到金字塔的塔结尔冷
Segment #22  [00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,280] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 11 | Text: 你都没有机会去做到一千万
Segment #23  [00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,700] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 12 | Text: 老铁你就比方说二零二五年了
Segment #24  [00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,160] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 兄弟咱现在去卖BB机
Segment #25  [00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,180] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 咱去卖光盘
Segment #26  [00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:54,680] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 15 | Text: 你就把命打上你一年都赚不到十万块钱
Segment #27  [00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:54,960] | Elapsed:  31.66s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #28  [00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,260] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 选择大于努力
Segment #29  [00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:00,100] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后第二点就是选产品
Segment #30  [00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:03,020] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 11 | Text: 你会发现一年大凡是利润
Segment #31  [00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:05,200] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 11 | Text: 年利润过一千万以上的生意
Segment #32  [00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,600] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 它都具备几个特点
Segment #33  [00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,640] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 第一要么就是高复购
Segment #34  [00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,960] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 复购非常的高
Segment #35  [00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,140] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 虽然客弹价不够
Segment #36  [00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:13,960] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 12 | Text: 但是它一直会有长期不断的粘性
Segment #37  [00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:14,460] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 有复购
Segment #38  [00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:16,840] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 第二就是客弹价高的
Segment #39  [00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:18,020] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 虽然我复购不高
Segment #40  [00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:20,420] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是我客弹价很高
Segment #41  [00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:21,380] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 我带一个是一个
Segment #42  [00:01:21,380 --> 00:01:22,480] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 我可能半年不开张
Segment #43  [00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,380] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 开张吃好几年
Segment #44  [00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,620] | Elapsed:  49.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 第三就是真正赚钱的生意
Segment #45  [00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:27,280] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 一定是特别轻松的
Segment #46  [00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,880] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 你千万别相信什么
Segment #47  [00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:30,640] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 哎呀我亲老师能致富的
Segment #48  [00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,180] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 我通过我不尽量的努力
Segment #49  [00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:33,340] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 我一定会获取财富
Segment #50  [00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:35,940] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 这种理念中千万不要相信
Segment #51  [00:01:35,940 --> 00:01:36,900] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 这就通话故事
Segment #52  [00:01:37,540 --> 00:01:39,560] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 12 | Text: 如果你付出了百分之一百的精力
Segment #53  [00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,220] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 只赚到了百分之二十的钱
Segment #54  [00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:43,100] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 我相信有可能你大概率
Segment #55  [00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:45,220] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 11 | Text: 一开始你的行业他妈就选错了
Segment #56  [00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,580] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 我把手机架上
Segment #57  [00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:48,020] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 我给你们举个例子
Segment #58  [00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:50,580] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 11 | Text: 比方说我剩下的这件衣服
Segment #59  [00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:53,500] | Elapsed:  66.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 咱假定他现在才两百块钱
Segment #60  [00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:55,440] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 11 | Text: 零售客弹价我花两百块钱
Segment #61  [00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:56,220] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 6  | Text: 买到这件衣服
Segment #62  [00:01:56,860 --> 00:01:58,860] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 12 | Text: 这两百块钱分别划给了谁呢
Segment #63  [00:01:58,860 --> 00:02:01,240] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 13 | Text: 厂家做这个衣服的裁缝运机在会
Segment #64  [00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:03,260] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 销售的搞渠道的
Segment #65  [00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:05,320] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 9  | Text: 无论我是传统的门店买
Segment #66  [00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,180] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 5  | Text: 线下商场买
Segment #67  [00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:07,380] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 还是我在直播带货里
Segment #68  [00:02:07,380 --> 00:02:08,240] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 6  | Text: 我找一个主播买
Segment #69  [00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:09,760] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 4  | Text: 那么我想请问
Segment #70  [00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:12,180] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是制造这个衣服的厂家
Segment #71  [00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:15,080] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 14 | Text: 他是不是就付出了百分之一百的努力
Segment #72  [00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,460] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 10 | Text: 只赚到了百分之二十的钱
Segment #73  [00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:18,100] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 我还得承担风险
Segment #74  [00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:19,860] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 6  | Text: 开工厂养工人
Segment #75  [00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:21,960] | Elapsed:  84.85s | Words: 4  | Text: 我可能一劲
Segment #76  [00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,860] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 代价工只有几块钱的利润
Segment #77  [00:02:24,180 --> 00:02:25,580] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 而且我还得去压资金
Segment #78  [00:02:25,940 --> 00:02:27,060] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 库村压力非常大
Segment #79  [00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:29,320] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是如果说去卖这件衣服呢
Segment #80  [00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:32,380] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 比方说我在商场开个市场门店
Segment #81  [00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,520] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 我有可能六十块钱进化成本
Segment #82  [00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,480] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 我就卖一百九十九
Segment #83  [00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:37,860] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 15 | Text: 我能赚到接近一百四十块钱的利润
Segment #84  [00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:39,760] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 我就付出了百分之一百的努力
Segment #85  [00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,540] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 11 | Text: 但是我赚到了百分之六十的钱
Segment #86  [00:02:42,060 --> 00:02:43,680] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 13 | Text: 但是互联网带货主播就不一样了
Segment #87  [00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,160] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 有可能我在直播间老铁卖
Segment #88  [00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,380] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 三二一箱子一摊
Segment #89  [00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,320] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 比方说一百九十九
Segment #90  [00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,680] | Elapsed: 103.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 如果现在很
Segment #91  [00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:51,560] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为你们包括现在所看到的
Segment #92  [00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,820] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多流量大的主播
Segment #93  [00:02:53,820 --> 00:02:55,340] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 8  | Text: 他一出他都几万的
Segment #94  [00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:56,560] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 4  | Text: 你们能懂吗
Segment #95  [00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:57,940] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 5  | Text: 他只要量大
Segment #96  [00:02:57,940 --> 00:03:00,220] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 11 | Text: 他就有去给人谈判的资格
Segment #97  [00:03:00,820 --> 00:03:03,960] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 15 | Text: 有可能他就是付出了百分之二十的努力
Segment #98  [00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,760] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 11 | Text: 付出了百分之二十的经历
Segment #99  [00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,300] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 10 | Text: 他赚到了百分之三百的钱
Segment #100 [00:03:07,300 --> 00:03:08,820] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 所有钱都让他赚了
Segment #101 [00:03:08,820 --> 00:03:10,360] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 9  | Text: 你看那些新马尔选人哥
Segment #102 [00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,540] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们不就是这个例子吗
Segment #103 [00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:14,000] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 8  | Text: 所以说选赛道是一个点
Segment #104 [00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:14,860] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 4  | Text: 再有一个就是
Segment #105 [00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:16,840] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 9  | Text: 整个赛道的产量当中
Segment #106 [00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,800] | Elapsed: 120.12s | Words: 6  | Text: 你属于哪个环
Segment #107 [00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:20,040] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 11 | Text: 刚才我说的厂家才风声机
Segment #108 [00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,720] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个这就是最重的
Segment #109 [00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:22,500] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 最不赚钱的
Segment #110 [00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:23,700] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 开明店的呢
Segment #111 [00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:24,680] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 这个是没有能力
Segment #112 [00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,440] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 确实没办法
Segment #113 [00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:26,940] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 我没就是会互联网
Segment #114 [00:03:26,940 --> 00:03:27,780] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 我以我的能力
Segment #115 [00:03:27,780 --> 00:03:28,760] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 我就开个明店的
Segment #116 [00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:30,840] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后做网红色混了
Segment #117 [00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,200] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 做互联网渠道的
Segment #118 [00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,100] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 做网络销售的
Segment #119 [00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:35,100] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 他就属于整个就是
Segment #120 [00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:37,340] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 10 | Text: 在这个服装的这个角度来讲
Segment #121 [00:03:37,340 --> 00:03:38,420] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 他就属于
Segment #122 [00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:40,280] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 进了他的顶端了
Segment #123 [00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,120] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以说老铁卖知道
Segment #124 [00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,620] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 怎么样选生意了吗
Segment #125 [00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:44,800] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后就牵扯到
Segment #126 [00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,500] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 还有另外一个点
Segment #127 [00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:47,100] | Elapsed: 139.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是会不会的问题
Segment #128 [00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:49,060] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 11 | Text: 到了你天天你这风情云烂了
Segment #129 [00:03:49,060 --> 00:03:49,880] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 7  | Text: 你怎么说互联网谎
Segment #130 [00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,680] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 7  | Text: 我的小学都没毕业
Segment #131 [00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,620] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 我不会干咱们这个
Segment #132 [00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,000] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 关于这个点回头
Segment #133 [00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:55,780] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 5  | Text: 我初期视频
Segment #134 [00:03:55,780 --> 00:03:57,080] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 9  | Text: 专门再详细的聊一下吧
Segment #135 [00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:57,740] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 4  | Text: 所有的东西
Segment #136 [00:03:57,740 --> 00:03:58,760] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 5  | Text: 不是在娘胎里
Segment #137 [00:03:59,100 --> 00:04:00,060] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 6  | Text: 生出来的这一刻
Segment #138 [00:04:00,060 --> 00:04:01,220] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 7  | Text: 就带到这个世界上的
Segment #139 [00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:03,100] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 8  | Text: 我天生也不会做短片
Segment #140 [00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:05,040] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 10 | Text: 我也不是在我出生的那一刻
Segment #141 [00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,060] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 10 | Text: 伴随着我妈妈的肚子里
Segment #142 [00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:09,160] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 5  | Text: 同时带出来一个
Segment #143 [00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:10,240] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 8  | Text: 一百万粉丝的账号
Segment #144 [00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:10,680] | Elapsed: 157.94s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #145 [00:04:11,140 --> 00:04:11,860] | Elapsed: 157.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 出来混什么
Segment #146 [00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:13,160] | Elapsed: 157.95s | Words: 4  | Text: 最重要的是出来
Segment #147 [00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:13,860] | Elapsed: 157.95s | Words: 3  | Text: 兄弟啊
Segment #148 [00:04:13,860 --> 00:04:15,000] | Elapsed: 157.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 先干了再说
Segment #149 [00:04:15,540 --> 00:04:16,760] | Elapsed: 157.95s | Words: 5  | Text: 不会你就先研究
Segment #150 [00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,320] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 2  | Text: 先拍
Segment #151 [00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:17,940] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 2  | Text: 先做
Segment #152 [00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:18,740] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 3  | Text: 先整的
Segment #153 [00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:19,580] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 2  | Text: 先干
Segment #154 [00:04:19,580 --> 00:04:20,280] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 干了再说
Segment #155 [00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:21,340] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 你所有的问题在
Segment #156 [00:04:22,580 --> 00:04:23,600] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 这个过程中
Segment #157 [00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,060] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 9  | Text: 在时间中都会得到答案
Segment #158 [00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:26,320] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 8  | Text: 你会做得越来越好
Segment #159 [00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,320] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 2  | Text: 先干
Segment #160 [00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:27,940] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 干了再说
Segment #161 [00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:29,460] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 3  | Text: 我发现
Segment #162 [00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:30,220] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 2  | Text: 人穷
Segment #163 [00:04:30,220 --> 00:04:31,100] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 3  | Text: 主要就是
Segment #164 [00:04:31,100 --> 00:04:31,920] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 要么没钱
Segment #165 [00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,620] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 要么没胆
Segment #166 [00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:33,660] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 要么害怕失败
Segment #167 [00:04:33,660 --> 00:04:34,600] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 到时候我不能干
Segment #168 [00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,080] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 3  | Text: 我干了
Segment #169 [00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,080] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 我失败怎么办
Segment #170 [00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:36,860] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 3  | Text: 哎呀我
Segment #171 [00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:38,360] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 我这个拍肚子
Segment #172 [00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,380] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 7  | Text: 我怕我身边心疼
Segment #173 [00:04:39,380 --> 00:04:40,380] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 4  | Text: 笑话怎么办
Segment #174 [00:04:41,220 --> 00:04:42,340] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 5  | Text: 那就做穷人了
Segment #175 [00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:42,700] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 2  | Text: 兄弟
Segment #176 [00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:44,460] | Elapsed: 174.78s | Words: 6  | Text: 那就穷一辈子了
Segment #177 [00:04:44,460 --> 00:04:44,540] | Elapsed: 181.57s | Words: 1  | Text: 好
Segment #178 [00:04:45,260 --> 00:04:46,460] | Elapsed: 181.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 行不错了
Segment #179 [00:04:46,460 --> 00:04:46,720] | Elapsed: 181.57s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
Segment #180 [00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,240] | Elapsed: 181.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 兄弟们
Segment #181 [00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,320] | Elapsed: 181.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 越来越好
